# results.config - dso-docker-escape
# REGEX ".+" trich token1 (KHONG dung LINE - bug framework).
# CHONG BYPASS: flag + hostmarker so parameter.* (HASH_REPLACE, nam tren host-sim,
# SV khong co shell) -> chi doc duoc sau khi escape that.
